{
  "id": "great-commission-06",
  "checkpoint": 6,
  "title": "The Plan of Redemption",
  "summary": "Paul explica a seu novo amigo o grande panorama do plano da redenção: da criação perfeita à cruz de Cristo e a restauração final.",
  "audio_url": "/audios/great-commission-06.mp3",
  "word_count_target": 140,
  "story_en": "Sitting under the shade of an olive tree, Paul unrolls a parchment notebook to illustrate the biblical plan of redemption. “God created humanity for intimate fellowship,” Paul explains gently. “In the beginning, harmony and peace ruled the earth.”\n\nHe points to a broken line in his drawing. “When humanity chose disobedience, sin entered the world, bringing spiritual death and separation from the Creator. No human effort could bridge that deep chasm.”\n\nPaul turns the page toward a sketch of the cross. “Throughout history, God promised a Savior. Jesus Christ came as the perfect sacrifice, paying the penalty for our sins and defeating death through his glorious resurrection.”\n\n“Through simple faith in Him,” Paul adds with joy, “we receive eternal life today and look forward to the complete restoration of all creation.”",
